# Dependencies & local artifacts
node_modules/
**/node_modules/
**/node_modules
remotion-composer/node_modules/
.playwright-cli/
/.brains/
/.opencode/
# Generated local verification fixtures/cache/evidence, not product source; retain on disk.
/.quality-run/
*.temp
*.log
*.tgz

# Binaries
*.exe
*.test
bin/facet-*
bin/facet
bin/facet-ui
bin/videokit
!bin/*.js

# Media produced by tests or ad-hoc runs. Two paid-generation images were
# committed accidentally because a test invoked a provider for real; the tests
# no longer bill, and generated media never belongs in the tree.
/internal/module/*.png
/internal/module/*.jpg
/internal/module/*.mp4
/internal/module/*.mp3

# Scratch probes from coordinating sessions. Three sessions work in this tree
# at once, and `git add -A` cannot tell a peer's temporary file from my own: a
# Midden probe named zz_jc_test.go was captured mid-commit and broke the build
# for the whole package.
#
# The prefix is the convention peers are asked to use for throwaway files, so
# a capture is impossible rather than merely unlikely.
zz_*_test.go
zz_*.go

# Built module package. Reproduced by scripts/build-module.sh; the binary and
# copied content are build output, not source.
/dist/
